        <gr str="3947">drawn </gr>to <gr str="4194">death</gr>, and <STYLE css="font-style:italic">those that are </STYLE>
        <gr str="4131">ready </gr>to be <gr str="2027">slain</gr>;</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="12">If thou <gr str="559">sayest</gr>, Behold, we <gr str="3045">knew </gr>it not; doth not he that <gr str="8505">weigheth </gr>the <gr str="3826">heart </gr>
