        </DIV>
      </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="21">My <gr str="1121">son</gr>, <gr str="3372">fear </gr>thou the <gr str="3068">LORD </gr>and the <gr str="4428">king</gr>: <STYLE css="font-style:italic">and </STYLE>
