      <VERS vnumber="23">These <STYLE css="font-style:italic">things</STYLE> also <STYLE css="font-style:italic">belong</STYLE> to the <gr str="2450">wise</gr>. <STYLE css="font-style:italic">It is</STYLE> not <gr str="2896">good </gr>to have <gr str="5234">respect </gr>of <gr str="6440">persons </gr>in <gr str="4941">judgment</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="24">He that <gr str="559">saith </gr>to the <gr str="7563">wicked</gr>, Thou <STYLE css="font-style:italic">art </STYLE>
