      <VERS vnumber="28">Be not a <gr str="5707">witness </gr>against thy <gr str="7453">neighbour </gr>without <gr str="2600">cause</gr>; and <gr str="6601">deceive </gr>
        <STYLE css="font-style:italic">not</STYLE> with thy <gr str="8193">lips</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="29">
        <gr str="559">Say </gr>not, I will <gr str="6213">do </gr>so to him as he hath <gr str="6213">done </gr>to me: I will <gr str="7725">render </gr>to the <gr str="376">man </gr>according to his <gr str="6467">work</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="30">I <gr str="5674">went </gr>by the <gr str="7704">field </gr>of the <gr str="376 6102">slothful</gr>, and by the <gr str="3754">vineyard </gr>of the <gr str="120">man </gr>
        <gr str="2638">void </gr>of <gr str="3820">understanding</gr>;</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="31">And, lo, it was all grown <gr str="5927">over </gr>with <gr str="7063">thorns</gr>, <STYLE css="font-style:italic">and </STYLE>
